# 🛡️ **3. FBAC vs RBAC (Slide-ready Comparison Table)**

### 🟦 **RBAC (what most competitors will propose)**

*   Predefined roles (HQ, District, Upazila)
*   Wide permissions
*   Hard to scale for national networks
*   Easily misused
*   Not enough for government-grade systems

### 🟩 **FBAC (what FinkOps will propose)**

*   Permission per feature, function, action
