*   Ideal for 66k schools and layered administration    [\[Inventory Software | PDF\]](https://mnithmde-my.sharepoint.com/personal/md_amanullah_mni_thm_de/Documents/Microsoft%20Copilot%20Chat%20Files/Inventory%20Software.pdf)

